    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to",
